 between 80 and 250. Each starter subscriber adds £49 a month to monthly recurring revenue. Each starter subscriber costs about £6 a month in support. Keeping pricing as it is adds nothing.","assistant_message":"I’ve mapped the three pricing choices against your goal of at least **£126,000 MRR** within nine months. A provisional first pass ran on the drafted model, but none of its assumptions has been validated, so it is something to challenge rather than an answer.\n\nYour £6 starter support cost is not deducted from MRR; it matters if the real objective is net recurring contribution or profit. The key uncertainties are whether price-related losses scale linearly to 10%, and starter-tier acquisition and retention by month nine.\n\nThe model was saved. Questions this model does not answer yet: Does \"monthly recurring revenue\" get there within 9 months? The model holds the deadline; no result answers that yet. The stated £6/month support cost per starter subscriber is not modelled as a causal deduction from monthly recurring revenue: support cost affects profitability, not MRR, under the facts provided. Confirm whether the decision should instead optimise net recurring contribution or profit, and provide the current baseline for that metric if so. (2 of 4 shown.)"},{"turn_id":"85ff5ecb-a01c-4230-ba63-e6accd7a5f93","created_at":"2026-10-07T00:54:22.621+00:00","user_message":"Run analysis","assistant_message":"Your results are ready. You can view them now or ask me to explain them."},{"turn_id":"b9f6d8e5-5ab0-4156-b4cd-89b61aa01126","created_at":"2026-10-07T00:54:34.556289+00:00","user_message":"Explain this result","assistant_message":"No single option can be put forward: this model’s comparison is a near tie and small changes could alter it.\n\nRecorded chances of reaching at least £126,000 MRR are:\n- Raise prices 10%: about 46%.\n- Launch starter tier: about 46%.\n- Keep pricing as is: less than 1%, holding today’s values.\n\nThese depend partly on Olumi’s assumptions about uncertainty and whether links hold. The nine-month timing remains unanswered.\n\n‘monthly recurring revenue’ was checked against the figures in your model. For ‘Raise prices 10%’ and ‘Launch starter tier’ it couldn’t be checked: those options move it through a link Olumi hasn’t sized in this limit’s units.","suggested_actions":[{"id":"agent-next-pre-mortem","label":"Run a pre-mortem","message":"Run a pre-mortem with me: imagine this decision went badly. What most plausibly went wrong?"},{"id":"agent-next-widen","label":"Suggest options","message":"Suggest options I haven’t considered."},{"id":"agent-next-strengthen","label":"Strengthen the model","message":"What would most strengthen this model?"}]}],"request_id":"804d03bc-eff2-48eb-849c-79a4d74f3f61"}}